=== multi-file shapes demo ===

Per-shape reports (cross-namespace dispatch):
   Circle r=5 => area=7850 satisfies?=true
   Rectangle 3x4 => area=12 satisfies?=true
   Triangle b=6 h=4 => area=24 satisfies?=true
   Square of side 42 => area=1764 satisfies?=true
   Label: hello => area=0 satisfies?=true
   Unknown: :unknown-shape => area=0 satisfies?=true

Aggregate state:
  total-area atom = 9650

satisfies? probes (cross-namespace protocol ref):
  p/Shape ⊇ Circle   ? true
  p/Shape ⊇ Triangle ? true
  p/Shape ⊇ :fixnum  ? true
  p/Shape ⊇ :string  ? true
  p/Shape ⊇ :keyword ? (caught by :any) => true

stdlib over the protocol dispatch:
  every? satisfies? p/Shape:  true
  frequencies of describe-prefixes:
    {Circle 1, Rectangle 1, Triangle 1, Square 1, Label: 1, Unknown: 1}

=== demo complete ===
